  "seoBody": "<p>You pay £75 a month for each phone number that did at least one check that month. Everyone else is free. There is no trial clock. You start on the free plan, with no card.</p><h2>The plans</h2><p>[[price:bundles]]. The free plan gives you 10 Records a month, with up to 10 photos in each. Paid accounts have no limits: reports, photos and messages are unlimited.</p><p>Big team? <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">Talk to us</a>.</p><h2>Payment</h2><p>We bill every month by UK Direct Debit. You set it up once. We do not store card numbers.</p><h2>How the bill works</h2><p>Each month you pay £75 for each phone number that did at least one check. The lowest bill is £75 a month. Numbers that did no check cost nothing.</p><h2>Moving up from free</h2><p>When 10 Records a month is not enough, add a Direct Debit. Your team works the same way. The limit goes.</p><h2>Cancelling</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. Your plan ends at the next billing date. Download your data first. See <a href=\"/pages/help/privacy.html\">Data and privacy</a>.</p><h2>Invoices</h2><p>Each payment sends an invoice to your main admin. Need an old one again? Email us.</p><p>Still stuck? Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. We reply within one business day.</p>",
